# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# MacOS
.DS_Store 

# Test binary, build with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool, specifically when used with LiteIDE
*.out

examples/test/test.go
examples/genmaps/genmaps
examples/genmaps/*.png
data/packetid/generate.go
.idea/
.vscode/

temp//world/

# Runtime artifacts (never committed)
/temp/
# NOTE: do NOT ignore /world/ — it is the Go world subsystem package, not a
# runtime save dir. Runtime world saves live under /temp/ (regionDir is empty
# by default). Ignoring /world/ shadows new source files in the package.
